{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月28日 一名自稱Google DeepMind倫敦辦公室前工程師的用户在社交平台爆料，稱Google於11月19日一次性解僱了Gemini 4基準測試團隊全部11名工程師，解僱理由為「未經授權訪問評估基礎設施」和「意圖損害公司聲譽」。該工程師稱，被解僱前他曾通過內部研究誠信渠道報告Gemini 4系列模型存在基準測試分數與實際部署權重不一致的問題。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588310.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T07:47:10.609688+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":183,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T07:17:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T07:40:31.447730+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T07:40:31.447730+00:00","content_hash":"88364885547cd88ef4cbc98a74bf1a6978b57bc66df6ac124286139734f9e936","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}